  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 🧪 BIA 662: Lab 2 - Controlling the Ghost in the Machine\n",
        "**Topic:** LLM Inference Parameters & Prompt Engineering\n",
        "\n",
        "In this lab, we will look \"under the hood\" of Large Language Models. We aren't just chatting; we are controlling the **inference engine**. We will adjust parameters that control how the model \"thinks\" and selects the next word.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Learning Objectives:**\n",
        "1.  **Temperature:** Understand the trade-off between \"Fact/Logic\" (Low Temp) and \"Creativity/Chaos\" (High Temp).\n",
        "2.  **System Prompts:** Learn how to \"condition\" the model to adopt a specific persona or output format (JSON).\n",
        "3.  **Hallucinations:** Intentionally break the model to see how it fabricates information.\n",
        "4.  **Determinism:** Use `seed` values to make AI outputs reproducible.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Prerequisite:** You need a [Groq API Key](https://console.groq.com/keys)."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "N49RVJL2uhzT"
      }
    },
    {
