            "The glow-necked Marsupial, a wondrous species found amidst the breathtaking landscapes of northern Sweden, has evolved a remarkable life. This enigmatic creature, belonging to a previously undocumented phylum called 'Luminaris Marsupiales,' thrives on a specialized diet comprising predominantly lumi...\n",
            "\n",
